Z||000020||AusFiero||06-24-2001||10:54 PM||||Well I am home. Thanks everyone for the well wishes I appreciate them greatly. Our hospitals don't like to keep you in long. I was suprised they sent me home actually but they are the "experts" on these matters.<P>I have been battling an unknown illness for a few years that occassionally just wipes me out physically and makes me pass out. No idea why as yet. I feel ok now, not 100% but ok, but have been ordered to rest a couple of days. Which is advise I might actually follow this time.<P>Anybody waiting for this pile of consoles sitting in my garage will have to wait for dispatching on Wednesday as I have to personally fill in the customs forms at this end it seems and really dont feel like battling the crowds in the central business district at the present moment. Angie can't do it for me as it isn't her business and it would negate the insurance if I needed to make a claim for lost goods.<P>On another note it has made me re-evaluate my work life as I currently work 16 hours a day 6 to 7 days a week. I am giving up my web design firm as it is a huge stress bringer being a service industry. Good money but just too many headaches. Will give me more time to do what I really like. CUSTOM CARS.<P>I will be ok and again thanks for the well wishes. Knowing people care is therapy in itself. I am going to lie down now and veg out with my kids in front of the daughters Playstation.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
Z||000021||Galen||06-24-2001||11:07 PM||||Glad to hear you're alright.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Who else would we turn to for killer custom 'edited' cars with you? <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/kid.gif">         <BR>1988 Hawaiin Orchid Coupe  <BR>AIM: GalenRPG||||reg||1
Z||000022||DaRkLoRD||06-25-2001||01:11 AM||||Aus, I just saw this thread tonight as I haven't been online much in the last couple of days.. I'm glad to hear you're feeling better! I'm not in the best of health either, I'm awaiting the results of my cat scan, and sometime I need to go for more chest x-rays and an MRI (woo)<BR>that should be interesting.. one of my friends who had an MRI for a severe concussion got bored during her test and fell asleep INSIDE the MRI unit!!<P>Anyway, I definitely understand what you mean about web design, work is pretty slow here at the moment, but in the past I've worked for 18+ hours a day to get a project done on time, to the client's satisfaction.. didn't help that every image I sent them, they changed their mind about what they wanted.. oh well. I wish I could get a job working with custom cars/car mods.. I couldn't even hope of matching your skills however..<P>but anyway, I'm glad you're better.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
